    <decisions>
        <description>A new process was put in place to have several nested picklists for Closed Lost, which include a new field for &quot;Closed Lost Group&quot; and &quot;Sub Reason Lost&quot; that may or may not be populated.</description>
        <name>Were_Closed_Lost_Group_and_possibly_Sub_Reason_passed_through</name>
